================================================================================
UPSTREAM SOURCE AND REQUIRED ATTRIBUTION
================================================================================

This repository is an aggregation and normalization of third-party threat
intelligence feeds. It does not create original indicators. The NonCommercial
restriction above is inherited from its upstream source and cannot be waived by
the maintainer of this repository.

Aggregated source:

  Phishing Army Blocklist Extended
  Copyright (c) Andrea Draghetti
  https://phishing.army/
  Licensed under CC BY-NC 4.0

Any redistribution of this data, in whole or in part, must credit Andrea
Draghetti and link to the CC BY-NC 4.0 license.

