COMPATIBILITY NOTICE
================================================================================

The companion repository malicious_ip_addresses is published under GPL-3.0.

  https://github.com/chelsinforce/malicious_ip_addresses

CC BY-NC 4.0 and GPL-3.0 are incompatible licenses. The two datasets are
deliberately kept in separate repositories and MUST NOT be merged into a single
file or distributed as a single combined work.

